  mem0ai/mem0 (the memory reconciliation pattern)
  https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0

  The reconcile step of enrichment (Phase 2.5, src/lib/enrichment/): new
  information is reconciled into a stored entry as one operation per
  entry — ADD, UPDATE, DELETE or NOOP in mem0, here ADD, UPDATE, REMOVE or
  NO_CHANGE per bible field — each tied to the source it is drawn from.
  Re-implemented for Inkquisitor (vocabulary.ts, schema.ts, validate.ts,
  prompt.ts); no mem0 code, prompt or text is copied, imported or
  redistributed, and it is not a dependency of this project. The project is
  distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

  pipelock (AI guard rule taxonomy)
  https://github.com/luckyPipewrench/pipelock

  The prompt-injection and secret/exfil (DLP) rule TAXONOMY of the model
